"The ceiling is the colour of a hospital ceiling. Somebody has put your shoes in a bag. The nurse says two men brought you in and did not leave a name, and that the fight was, in her words, \"a draw with extra steps\".",
"The chair is plastic and the clock is loud. It helps anyway.",
"The city at night from five floors up: a million windows, every one of them somebody else's problem. A helicopter goes over. Somebody on the next roof is playing the same song you were thinking of.",
